--- !u!114 &1856721115414775540
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1765208974763639548}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b><size=28>C\xC1C L\xC1 B\xC0I</size></b>\r\n\r\n<b><color=#FFD700>\xDD
    ngh\u0129a c\xE1c ch\u1EC9 s\u1ED1 tr\xEAn l\xE1 b\xE0i:</color></b>\r\n\r\n-
    <b>Damage (S\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng):</b> L\u01B0\u1EE3ng s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
    g\xE2y cho \u0111\u1ED1i th\u1EE7\r\n- <b>Emotion Value (Gi\xE1 tr\u1ECB c\u1EA3m
    x\xFAc):</b> Thay \u0111\u1ED5i thanh Emometer c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n\r\n- <b>Stamina
    Cost (Chi ph\xED th\u1EC3 l\u1EF1c):</b> S\u1ED1 stamina c\u1EA7n \u0111\u1EC3
    s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng l\xE1 b\xE0i\r\n\r\n<b><color=#FFD700>C\xE1c lo\u1EA1i c\u1EA3m
    x\xFAc:</color></b>\r\n\r\n- <b><color=#FFFF00>Funny (Vui v\u1EBB)</color></b>
    - H\u1ED3i 10% HP t\u1ED1i \u0111a\r\n- <b><color=#4169E1>Bored (Bu\u1ED3n b\xE3)</color></b>
    - Gi\u1EA3m 15% DMG g\xE2y ra\r\n- <b><color=#9370DB>Scared (S\u1EE3 h\xE3i)</color></b>
    - Ng\u1EABu nhi\xEAn gi\u1EEFa n\xE9 \u0111\xF2n ho\u1EB7c b\u1ECB v\xF4 hi\u1EC7u
    h\xF3a l\xE1 b\xE0i\r\n- <b><color=#FF69B4>Happy (H\u1EA1nh ph\xFAc)</color></b>
    - Kh\xF4ng m\u1EA5t Stamina\r\n- <b><color=#FF4500>Angry (Gi\u1EADn d\u1EEF)</color></b>
    - T\u0103ng 50% DMG l\xE1 b\xE0i v\xE0 m\u1EA5t 5% HP t\u1ED1i \u0111a\r\n\r\n\r\n<b><size=28>TR\u1EA0NG
    TH\xC1I BURNOUT</size></b>\r\n\r\n<b><color=#FFD700>Thanh Emometer:</color></b>\r\nThanh
    c\u1EA3m x\xFAc dao \u0111\u1ED9ng t\u1EEB <b>-10 \u0111\u1EBFn +10</b>\r\n\r\n-
    <b><color=#00FF00>V\xF9ng an to\xE0n:</color></b> T\u1EEB -5 \u0111\u1EBFn +5\r\n-
    <b><color=#FFA500>V\xF9ng c\u1EA3nh b\xE1o:</color></b> T\u1EEB -10 \u0111\u1EBFn
    -5 ho\u1EB7c +5 \u0111\u1EBFn +10\r\n\r\n<b><color=#FFD700>Burnout l\xE0 g\xEC?</color></b>\r\n\r\nKhi
    thanh c\u1EA3m x\xFAc \u0111\u1EA1t <b>\xB110</b>, b\u1EA1n s\u1EBD r\u01A1i
    v\xE0o tr\u1EA1ng th\xE1i <b>BURNOUT</b>:\r\n\r\n- <b><color=#00FF00>BURNOUT
    T\xCDCH C\u1EF0C (+10):</color></b>\r\n  C\u1EA3m x\xFAc qu\xE1 cao, m\u1EA5t
    BUFF c\u1EE7a c\xE1c l\xE1 t\xEDch c\u1EF1c, gi\u1EA3m 50% DMG l\xE1 t\xEDch
    c\u1EF1c\r\n\r\n- <b><color=#FF4500>BURNOUT TI\xCAU C\u1EF0C (-10):</color></b>\r\n 
    C\u1EA3m x\xFAc qu\xE1 th\u1EA5p, gi\u1EA3m 50% DMG l\xE1 ti\xEAu c\u1EF1c\r\n\r\n<b><color=#FFD700>L\u01B0u
    \xFD:</color></b> H\xE3y c\xE2n b\u1EB1ng vi\u1EC7c s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng c\xE1c
    l\xE1 b\xE0i \u0111\u1EC3 gi\u1EEF c\u1EA3m x\xFAc \u1EDF v\xF9ng an to\xE0n!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aadb65493cdbad47a50ab6e2a4309a3, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 7176867667951326709, guid: 8aadb65493cdbad47a50ab6e2a4309a3, type: 2}
